// Test47 moved 9/9 visible models but activation stayed tied to original zones.
 // Move safe/validated INACTIVE actors before first activation, if available.
 // If this does not change their load region, we must investigate sector-visibility
 // binding or move appearance instead; repeated teleports will not fix streaming.
 // Navigation, Murfy, Rayman and non-decorative actors remain protected.
// ===========================================================================
